 - State management hook\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ContradictionExplorer.tsx` - Main component\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ClaimComparison.tsx`\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/SourceQualityCompare.tsx`\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ResolutionSuggester.tsx`\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ConfidenceImpactSim.tsx`\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/ResolutionTracker.tsx`\n   - `src/app/api/contradictions/resolve/route.ts` - API route\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/contradictions/index.tsx`\n\n6. TypeScript compilation passed for contradiction explorer.\n\n7. The user then asked to execute the animated story mode requirement.\n\n8. I started working on the story mode:\n   - Created `src/lib/storyScript.ts` - Script generation library with narration templates, chapter detection, playback utilities\n   - Was about to create `useStoryPlayback` hook when the summary was requested\n\nThe current todo list shows:\n- Completed: Story script library\n- In progress: useStoryPlayback hook\n- Pending: StoryModePlayer, TimelineAnimator, EventHighlighter, ContextCard, ChapterNavigator, PlaybackControls, StoryExporter, TypeScript verification\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user requested execution of three requirement files in sequence:\n   1. `dir-1769788079711-build-advanced-force-directed-graph-with` - Build advanced force-directed graph with hierarchical clustering, path finding, and dynamic layout algorithms (COMPLETED)\n   2. `dir-1769788087174-implement-interactive-contradiction-explorer-with` - Implement interactive contradiction explorer with claim comparison, resolution suggestions, and confidence impact analysis (COMPLETED)\n   3. `dir-1769788092260-create-animated-story-mode-with` - Create animated story mode with auto-narrated timeline playback and exportable video timeline summaries (IN PROGRESS)\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Force-directed graph layouts with Barnes-Hut optimization\n   - Louvain community detection for hierarchical clustering\n   - Dijkstra shortest path algorithm\n   - Force-Directed Edge Bundling (FDEB)\n   - Web Workers for offloading heavy computation\n   - Canvas-based rendering for 500+ nodes\n   - Contradiction severity classification and resolution strategies\n   - Confidence impact simulation for what-if analysis\n   - Resolution voting and history tracking\n   - Story script generation with narration templates\n   - Chapter detection via event clustering\n   - Playback state management with timing calculations\n   - Theme integration (radar/swiss themes)\n   - Framer Motion animations\n   - localStorage for resolution/history persistence\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   **Network Graph System (Completed):**\n   - `src/lib/graphAlgorithms.ts` - Core algorithms (Louvain, Dijkstra, FDEB, layouts)\n   - `src/workers/graphLayout.worker.ts` - Web Worker for layout computation\n   - `src/hooks/useForceGraph.ts` - Graph state management hook\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/AdvancedNetworkGraph.tsx` - Main WebGL canvas component\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphMinimap.tsx` - Overview navigation\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/LayoutSwitcher.tsx` - Force/Radial/Tree switcher\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphFilterPanel.tsx` - Filter by node/edge types\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/PathFinder.tsx` - Shortest path UI\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/GraphExporter.tsx` - Export PNG/SVG/JSON\n   - `src/components/report/visualizations/network/index.tsx` - Module exports\n\n   **Contradiction Explorer System (Completed):**\n   - `src/lib/contradictionResolution.ts` - Severity classification, resolution strategies, confidence impact\n   - `src/hooks/useContradictionExplorer.ts` -